          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#0f1724;--bg2:#081021;--accent:#b28cff;--muted:#9aa3b2;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial}\\n    body{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#e8eef8;line-height:1.45}\\n    .viewport{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 32px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e9d7ff33,#a7e9ff22);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .navlinks a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\\n    header.hero{position:relative;padding:56px 32px 40px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .bg-svg{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.12}\\n    .hero-inner{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:32px 36px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(3,8,23,0.6)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:20px;margin-top:26px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .pillar{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(178,140,255,0.06),rgba(167,233,255,0.03));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    footer.cta{margin-top:32px;padding:26px 32px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,23,44,0.4),rgba(2,8,20,0.35));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-radius:12px}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7ad7ff);padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;color:#061226;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .small{font-size:13px}\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.navlinks{display:none}.hero-inner{padding:20px}.brand .title{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='viewport'>\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class='brand'>\\n        <div class='logo'>SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class='title' style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class='small muted'>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='navlinks'>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Gatherings</a>\\n        <a href='events.html'>Upcoming</a>\\n        <a href='private-sessions.html'>Private</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Reserve</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class='hero'>\\n      <!-- subtle SVG pattern -->\\n      <svg class='bg-svg' viewBox='0 0 1200 600' preserveAspectRatio='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n            <stop offset='0' stop-color='#b28cff' stop-opacity='0.18'/>\\n            <stop offset='1' stop-color='#7ad7ff' stop-opacity='0.06'/>\\n          </linearGradient>\\n          <pattern id='p1' width='80' height='80' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>\\n            <rect width='80' height='80' fill='transparent'/>\\n            <circle cx='10' cy='10' r='2' fill='url(#g1)' />\\n            <circle cx='70' cy='70' r='2' fill='url(#g1)' />\\n          </pattern>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect width='1200' height='600' fill='url(#p1)' />\\n      </svg>\\n\\n      <div class='hero-inner'>\\n        <h1>About our sound baths — the craft behind the calm</h1>\\n        <p class='lead'>We blend resonance, space, and care to guide journeys of stillness. {{BUSINESS_NAME}} is a boutique sanctuary for sensory restoration led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}.</p>\\n\\n        <div class='grid'>\\n          <div>\\n            <section class='card'>\\n              <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Our philosophy</h3>\\n              <p class='muted'>We treat sound as architecture for attention: each tone sculpts a room inside you. Sessions are curated to feel sensory, premium, and deeply held.</p>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>\\n              <h3>Instruments we favor</h3>\\n              <div class='pillars'>\\n                <div class='pillar'>Crystal singing bowls paired with metal chimes for bright overtones.</div>\\n                <div class='pillar'>Long-form gong washes that release tension across the body.</div>\\n                <div class='pillar'>Subtle Tibetan bowls for focused, mid-range harmonics.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>\\n              <h3>How a public session flows</h3>\\n              <p class='muted'>Guests arrive, settle with grounding breathwork, and are guided through 45–75 minutes of layered sound. We open with breath and intention, move into expansive tonal landscapes, then slow toward integration and silent reflection.</p>\\n            </section>\\n\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <aside>\\n            <div class='card'>\\n              <h4 style='margin:0'>Venue & access</h4>\\n              <p class='muted small'>Sessions hosted at {{VENUE_NAME}}. Limited capacity for an intimate environment. Wear comfortable layers; mats and blankets available.</p>\\n              <div style='height:12px'></div>\\n              <div class='muted small'><strong>Next gathering:</strong> {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n              <div style='height:14px'></div>\\n              <a class='btn' href='book.html'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n              <h4 style='margin:0'>A note on safety</h4>\\n              <p class='muted small'>Sound practices are restorative for most people. If you have a pacemaker, recent concussion, are pregnant, or have ongoing seizure disorders, consult a clinician before attending.</p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n          </aside>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <footer class='cta'>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style='font-weight:700'>Private sessions & bespoke sound design</div>\\n            <div class='muted small'>1:1, couple, and corporate offerings available — tailored to needs.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n            <a class='btn' href='private-sessions.html'>Private options</a>\\n            <a class='muted small' href='contact.html'>{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </footer>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main style='padding:28px 32px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto'>\\n      <section class='card'>\\n        <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Myth vs. truth — what people get wrong about sound baths</h3>\\n        <ul class='muted'>\\n          <li><strong>Myth:</strong> They're passive naps. <strong>Truth:</strong> They're active listening practices that can be deeply restorative without sleep.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Myth:</strong> One sound fits all. <strong>Truth:</strong> We layer tones to support different nervous-system states; each session is intentionally composed.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Myth:</strong> You must be spiritual. <strong>Truth:</strong> You only need willingness to sit with sensation — secular, clinical, and spiritual frames all exist.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style='margin-top:18px' class='card'>\\n        <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Case notes & testimonials</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>\\\"After a session with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, I left feeling like my body had more room.\\\" — A. from {{CITY}}</p>\\n        <p class='muted'>\\\"Deeply held and impeccably produced — the mix of bowls and chimes was luminous.\\\" — R.</p>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer style='padding:28px 32px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>\\n      <div>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div>Call: {{PHONE}} • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--muted)'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"faq.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>FAQ — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071022;--soft:#0a1624;--accent:#9bd3ff;--card:#081827;--muted:#9fb0c8}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#021825);color:#e7f3ff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial}\\n    header{padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7ad7ff22,#b28cff33);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px}\\n    main{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(154,211,255,0.06),rgba(178,140,255,0.03));padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:24px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .q{font-weight:700}\\n    .a{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#071833,transparent);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b28cff,#7ad7ff);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#021224;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    @media(max-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class='brand'>\\n      <div class='logo'>SB</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Sound baths • {{CITY}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class='nav'>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n      <a href='book.html'>Reserve</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <h1>Questions we often hear</h1>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0'>Practical answers for newcomers and returning guests — sensory-forward and safety-conscious.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class='grid'>\\n      <div>\\n        <section class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>\\n          <div class='faq-item'>\\n            <div class='q'>What should I bring?</div>\\n            <div class='a'>A yoga mat or cushion, warm layers, an eye pillow if you like, and an open mind. We provide extra blankets and bolsters upon request.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='faq-item'>\\n            <div class='q'>How long are sessions?</div>\\n            <div class='a'>Typical public sessions are 60–75 minutes. Private sessions vary from 45 minutes (intro) to 90 minutes for bespoke formats.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='faq-item'>\\n            <div class='q'>Are there contraindications?</div>\\n            <div class='a'>If you have a pacemaker, are pregnant, have epilepsy, or are recovering from surgery, please check with your healthcare provider before attending. Loud gong exposure may not be appropriate for some conditions.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='faq-item'>\\n            <div class='q'>Will I fall asleep?</div>\\n            <div class='a'>Some guests nap; others experience deep mental clarity. Both are normal. We structure sessions to include intentional periods of silence so integration can occur.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='faq-item'>\\n            <div class='q'>What instruments do you use?</div>\\n            <div class='a'>We rotate instruments seasonally — crystal bowls and Japanese rin bowls for high clarity, suspended gongs for long spectral washes, and chimes for micro-transitions.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Myth vs. truth — a short primer</h3>\\n          <p class='a'>Myth: sound baths are a one-size ritual. Truth: each session is composed with intention — breathwork, graded dynamics, tonal arcs, and silent windows for embodiment.</p>\\n        </section>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>For private bookings</h4>\\n          <p class='a small'>We design 1:1, couples, and corporate offerings — focused on outcomes like relaxation, focus, or team cohesion.</p>\\n          <div style='height:12px'></div>\\n          <a class='btn' href='private-sessions.html'>Explore private</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Sensory guidance</h4>\\n          <p class='a small'>We keep volume appropriate for therapeutic listening. If you prefer lower levels, tell the facilitator on arrival and we'll adapt the instrumentation.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Contact</h4>\\n          <p class='a small'>Questions? Reach us at <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='card'>\\n      <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Short case notes</h3>\\n      <p class='a'>A recent corporate session requested soundscaping for a focus day: we used tuning forks and a monochord to create a narrow band of tones that supported collective attention. Feedback reported decreased reactivity and increased team clarity.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class='cta'>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>Still have questions?</strong>\\n        <div class='a small'>Call {{PHONE}} or email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{EMAIL}}</a>. New to sound baths? Try a public evening to experience the form.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class='btn' href='book.html'>Book a spot</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#061226;--panel:#092234;--accent:#b28cff;--accent2:#7ad7ff;--muted:#a9bfce}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#021018);color:#eaf6ff;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    .lead{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:inherit}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));color:#021224;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .flow .step{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(122,215,255,0.08);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.links{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800;font-size:18px'>Reserve with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class='muted' style='margin-top:6px'>Mindful sound baths and private sessions • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='links'>\\n        <a href='events.html'>Events</a>\\n        <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <p class='lead'>Choose a public session or request a private experience. We honor accessibility and bespoke requests — include notes in the form below.</p>\\n\\n    <div class='split'>\\n      <main>\\n        <section class='panel'>\\n          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Book a spot</h3>\\n          <form action='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' method='post' style='margin-top:10px'>\\n            <label>Name<input type='text' name='name' placeholder='Your full name' required></label>\\n            <label>Email<input type='email' name='email' placeholder='you@example.com' required></label>\\n            <label>Phone<input type='tel' name='phone' placeholder='Optional'></label>\\n            <label>Which format<select name='format'>\\n              <option>Public group session</option>\\n              <option>1:1 private session</option>\\n              <option>Couples session</option>\\n              <option>Corporate / team</option>\\n            </select></label>\\n            <label>Date / time (preferred)<input type='text' name='datetime' placeholder='e.g. {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} or flexible'></label>\\n            <label>Notes / accessibility<textarea name='notes' rows='4' placeholder='Any preferences, hearing sensitivities, or accessibility needs'></textarea></label>\\n            <div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center'>\\n              <button class='btn' type='submit'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <div class='muted small'>Or call: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class='panel' style='margin-top:14px'>\\n          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>What to expect — the session flow</h3>\\n          <div class='flow'>\\n            <div class='step'><strong>Arrival & settle:</strong> 10–15 minutes for grounding and intention-setting.</div>\\n            <div class='step'><strong>Sound journey:</strong> 45–60 minutes of layered tones (breath, gradual dynamics, and silent intervals).</div>\\n            <div class='step'><strong>Integration:</strong> 10–15 minutes to journal, hydrate, and reorient.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='panel'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Bring / prepare</h4>\\n          <ul class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>\\n            <li>Yoga mat, cushion, or camp pad for comfort</li>\\n            <li>Layered clothing and socks; eye pillow recommended</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle — hydration supports integration</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style='height:12px'></div>\\n          <div class='pill'>Pricing varies by format</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='panel' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Safety & contraindications</h4>\\n          <p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>If you have a pacemaker, pregnancy concerns, seizure disorder, or recent head injury, please consult your physician before booking. For any tinnitus or sensitivity to low-frequency sound, state your preference and we'll adapt instrumentation (we often use a monochord or tuning forks for gentler profiles).</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='panel' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>A note on instrumentation</h4>\\n          <p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Sessions may feature a monochord, Tibetan bowls, and soft ocean drum textures — chosen to support relaxation without overwhelming the system.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Short case note</h3>\\n      <p class='muted'>A 1:1 client booked a session for sleep re-patterning; we used low-register tuning forks and a gentle mono-string drone over three sessions — reported improved sleep latency and deeper restorative cycles.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Frequently asked (quick)</h3>\\n      <p class='muted'><strong>Can I bring friends?</strong> Yes — for public sessions reserve multiple spots. For private events, we design a proposal based on headcount.</p>\\n      <p class='muted'><strong>Cancelation?</strong> Please review booking policy at check-out; contact us for rescheduling.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style='margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center'>\\n      Questions before you book? Email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}} — we respond within 48 hours.\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
      "role": "assistant"
    }
